## Agent implementations by platform

**Shared pattern for alarms**

1. Connect to **`wss://<host>/api/ws/<device_id>?token=<PAT>`** (percent-encode token and `device_id` if they contain reserved characters).
2. Read **text** frames only; each message is a JSON object with **`type`**.
3. On **`type == "alarm"`**, read **`alarm_id`** (string) and **`payload`** (object). Update UI on the **main thread** (Android main, UI thread, WinUI dispatcher, Qt GUI thread, Swift `MainActor` / main queue).
4. Send **`{"type":"ping"}`** every ~30s on a timer; handle **`pong`** if you log connectivity.
5. On disconnect or failure, **reconnect** with backoff; alarms are **not** replayed for time spent offline.

Optional: raise a **system notification** when an alarm arrives and the app is backgrounded (channels differ per OS; see each section).

