### Linux — Qt (C++)

| Topic | Guidance |
|-------|-----------|
| **Module** | **`QT += websockets`**; include **`#include <QtWebSockets/QWebSocket>`**. |
| **Connect** | **`QWebSocket socket;`** `socket.open(QUrl("wss://host/api/ws/linux-agent?token=..."));` |
