| **Ping** | **`QTimer`** every 30s: **`socket.sendTextMessage(R"({"type":"ping"})")`**. |
| **UX** | **`QSystemTrayIcon::showMessage`**, main-window **`QMessageBox`**, or QML **`Popup`** when **`type == "alarm"`**. |
| **TLS** | Trust store uses system CAs; for custom servers add certificate handling if needed. |

